{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve an absent carrier in the documented call**\n\nThis literal always creates `xRayTraceId`, so shared code running on ordinary Lambda turns an absent runtime capability into authoritative `undefined`. The helper then suppresses a valid `_X_AMZN_TRACE_ID` while the plugin extractor still uses it, producing different trace IDs. Show the same `\"xRayTraceId\" in context` guard used by the runtime-carrier example, passing no fourth argument when the property is absent.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs750quZ","finding_digest":"5826af0adaaf925d235a0df47b22bcf2023912a69496841de80ace8ae4ee04c3","finding_id":"arf_v1_latk6cw2v6jf2i22bx2hwiv46i","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/readme.md::deriveexecutiontraceid-managed-instance-example::carrier-presence-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/readme.md::deriveexecutiontraceid-managed-instance-example::carrier-presence-preservation","line":558,"observation_digest":"a1edf3bb6ad5613a19324b019c8a1ad71e7d65687d49c9df695062fb3b049fde","observation_id":"aro_v1_uhw7ho3k2vqtugjsjmazzcq224","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/README.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T03:45:54Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2vjteoww4kxvxqwlktse4mvwkz","reviewed_base_sha":"cc7db9bacb23278c58aecf16821737ba47797152","reviewed_head_sha":"2eb8207846c26a337f9fb3b36c899312e268dacb","reviewer":"codex","start_line":558,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":955},"record_id":"art_v1_zxiuhtecn35qurb7oocoekcsfc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T03:45:54Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
